Bash(git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
fix(#36): rebuild Tabs thin wrapper on native Base UI Tabs

The prior attempt on this branch pointed all Tabs imports directly at
raw @fumadocs/base-ui/components/tabs, which was believed not to
support groupId/persist/updateAnchor — a real regression, caught in
review (see .sandcastle/repair-context-36.md).

Tracing the installed package source instead of trusting docs shows
@fumadocs/base-ui/components/tabs already forwards unrecognized props
through to @fumadocs/base-ui/components/ui/tabs, which is where
groupId (cross-block sync via sessionStorage), persist (localStorage),
and updateAnchor (URL hash + hashchange) are actually implemented.
src/components/tabs.tsx is now a thin wrapper that re-declares these
three props explicitly on its own TabsProps for discoverability and
forwards everything to the native Tabs — no re-implementation needed.

Content pages already imported from '@/components/tabs', so none of
the 17 pages or the showcase page needed import changes. The local
Radix-backed src/components/ui/tabs.tsx primitive and the
@radix-ui/react-tabs dependency are now unused and deleted.

Replaces docs/reference/fumadocs/custom-tabs.md (which described the
old local reimplementation) with tabs-migration.md, documenting the
parity verification so a future reader doesn't have to re-derive it
from package internals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
)"
